="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>The recent outbreak of food poisoning in the country is certainly serious, although it is [not as widespread a problem as] has been suggested in the media.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7312.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>The recent outbreak of food poisoning in the country is certainly serious, although it is &lt;b&gt;not as widespread a problem as&lt;/b&gt; has been suggested in the media.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>When I fell awkwardly it felt like I had broken my ankle, but fortunately it was [not as serious an injury as] I first thought.	</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7313.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>When I fell awkwardly it felt like I had broken my ankle, but fortunately it was &lt;b&gt;not as serious an injury as&lt;/b&gt; I first thought.	</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>During my lunch breaks I usually go into the park and read. It is [as peaceful a place as] it is possible to find in the city. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7314.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>During my lunch breaks I usually go into the park and read. It is &lt;b&gt;as peaceful a place as&lt;/b&gt; it is possible to find in the city. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Khalid is [as excellent a student as] I have taught in all my time as a teacher.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7315.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Khalid is &lt;b&gt;as excellent a student as&lt;/b&gt; I have taught in all my time as a teacher.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Powering car engines with water rather than petrol is [not as crazy an idea as] it might sound, and scientists have already produced a prototype. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7316.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Powering car engines with water rather than petrol is &lt;b&gt;not as crazy an idea as&lt;/b&gt; it might sound, and scientists have already produced a prototype. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Think carefully before accepting the job. It is probably [as important a decision as] you will ever have to make. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7317.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Think carefully before accepting the job. It is probably &lt;b&gt;as important a decision as&lt;/b&gt; you will ever have to make. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>When I sat down I found it was [not as uncomfortable a chair as] it looked. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7318.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>When I sat down I found it was &lt;b&gt;not as uncomfortable a chair as&lt;/b&gt; it looked. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>It was [as spicy a curry as] I had ever eaten and I had to drink lots of water with it. </text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/7319.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>It was &lt;b&gt;as spicy a curry as&lt;/b&gt; I had ever eaten and I had to drink lots of water with it. </modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Chloe was always very organised and [as efficient a line manager as] any employer could wish for.</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/73110.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Chloe was always very organised and &lt;b&gt;as efficient a line manager as&lt;/b&gt; any employer could wish for.</modelAnswerString></question></question_xml><enableAudioOnChecked>false</enableAudioOnChecked><enableAudioOnClosed>true</enableAudioOnClosed><correctFeedback_str /><incorrectFeedback_str /><attemptsAllowed>1</attemptsAllowed></mcq_xml></params_xml><alignment>none</alignment><alignPercent>100</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" e